    <p class="community-stat__lede">Which public-domain books from <a href="/library/">the library</a> people actually start, type, and finish. <code>started</code> events fire on first paragraph; <code>finished</code> fires only when the full page is completed at 80%+ accuracy. Length matters: short works dominate completion counts.</p>
    <div class="community-stat__chart" data-umami-event="book_completion">
